;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\たき火.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―The smell of burning <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="たきぎ">firewood</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And a warm room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even before I opened my eyes, I knew I was inside somebody's house.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\囲炉裏2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I... 
{PAUSE ""}
that's right, that giant creature sent me flying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking back now, it does look like a boar, but a boar that far off the scale...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It must've just been a landslide that sent a giant boulder rolling down.<PG>
"Oh, you've come to."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a man's voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not old exactly, but likely a good deal older than me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... there was something off about the way he talked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow, for the language of Japan, the rise and fall of it sounded wrong...<PG>
"Ah, and you don't seem to have any serious injuries."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who was he? This man...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A Westerner had once come to call on my lord, and this man looked a lot like him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His clothes were like ours, but his face and build were clearly different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, more important than that, there seemed no doubt he was the one who'd saved me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
First, I had to thank him.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, it seems you've helped me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm much obliged..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I sat up and straightened myself, the Westerner looked even more <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="あんど">relieved</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hah hah hah! <STYLE ID="2">Traveler</STYLE>, this is a remote land where people hardly ever come. 
{PAUSE ""}
Please rest here well before you set off."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, that's truly more than I deserve... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh, forgive me for not introducing myself sooner. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm called </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ふじよしろう">Fujiyoshiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
"I am called <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にいむら">Ginosuke</STYLE> <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ぎのすけ">Niimura</STYLE>. I am the one who serves as this village's doctor. 
{PAUSE ""}
Ah, yes."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Westerner who called himself Ginosuke turned toward the next room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Clientes para trazer uma refeicao."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ginosuke, speaking words I couldn't make out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His name might be Japanese, but was he a Westerner after all?<PG>
Then a woman came in from the next room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, you've come to. You slept the whole night through!
{PAUSE ""}
　I'll get your meal ready right away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The woman speaking to me so <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="かいがい">attentively</STYLE> was Japanese, any way you looked at it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A village where Westerners and Japanese lived together―where on earth was this?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, Ginosuke-dono, what kind of village is this...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hah hah hah! So you do find it strange!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He seemed to know full well that this village was a strange place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And without seeming to mind it in particular―<PG>
"<STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ふじ">Fuji</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">-dono</STYLE>, this is a village called Arata. 
{PAUSE ""}
A remote land dozens of ri from where people live. 
{PAUSE ""}
For hundreds of years it has been an isolated village with almost no contact with the outside world."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "山桜夜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Hundreds of years ago, caught up in the war between the Emperor and the <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="たら">Tara</STYLE> clan, <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="や">a </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">personage </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="ごと">of </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="な">the highest </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">birth</STYLE> fled to this land, and that was the beginning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">He</STYLE> is said to have been trying to flee to the Eastern Capital, but along the way he was <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ひ">drawn</STYLE> to this land and stayed here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The beasts here are all large, and food is plentiful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For those who would live quietly, it is like a paradise.<PG>
And so this village has a side that is closed to outsiders.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We accept no daimyo's men whatsoever, and belong to no domain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anyone attacks by force, we unite as one and drive them off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is this village of Arata.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\囲炉裏2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Then why were you good enough to take me in? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'm from the outside world too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Fuji-dono</STYLE>, you are a traveler, are you not?
{PAUSE ""}
　This village is not so heartless as to abandon someone passing through. 
{PAUSE ""}
In fact, I too collapsed here 10 years ago, and was saved by the people of this village. 
{PAUSE ""}
So it is only right that I help you, <STYLE ID="2">Fuji-dono</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
One for all, all for one. 
{PAUSE ""}
That is how this village has survived until now, quietly, and yet with strength."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ginosuke-dono, you did say you came here 10 years ago... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">so you're from the West after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, I came here from the West. 
{PAUSE ""}
However, in the Eastern Capital, where we drifted ashore, foreigners like us were not welcome, it seems..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Drifted ashore... meaning?"</STYLE><PG>
"We had been entrusted with running a colony far from our Western homeland. 
{PAUSE ""}
But an <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="みぞう">unheard-of</STYLE> disaster struck there, and we fled by ship with only the clothes on our backs. Where we washed up was near this country's Eastern Capital."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And so Ginosuke-dono had put down roots in this land, changed his name to a Japanese-style one, and lived here like this, at home in the village.<PG>
But I had no intention of doing anything like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to get my hands on strength-giving food fast and go back to Owari.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no time left.<PG>
"I am not the only Westerner who made it here. About 20 of us are now in this village's care. 
{PAUSE ""}
All of them have grown quite used to life here, and their names have become Japanese-style too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, Ginosuke-dono, I hate to say this after you've looked after me, but I'm in a hurry, so―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, the woman from before came into the room.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Fuji-sama</STYLE>, sorry to keep you waiting. Eat this, and you'll be well again in no time."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The meal she set out looked like some kind of roasted game.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was this boar meat?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was in a hurry, but... I put a piece in my mouth.<PG>
I knew it before the meat even touched my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The aroma that tickled my <STYLE ID="16" RUBY="びこう">nostrils</STYLE> was far too <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ほうじゅん">rich</STYLE> for boar meat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In my mouth, it was soft as a cloud.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So good it seemed a waste to swallow: a powerful <STYLE ID="18" RUBY="じみ">savor</STYLE> that filled my whole mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even the choicest meat my lord had once let me eat came nowhere near this boar meat.<PG>
It was boar meat, sure enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it was a completely different food from the boar I knew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And besides tasting good, it seemed to be restorative too, as if strength were surging through my whole body.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"This meat, what on earth...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I thought it would surprise you!
{PAUSE ""}
　It is a giant boar that can only be caught around here. 
{PAUSE ""}
The beasts around here are big, and delicious. 
{PAUSE ""}
I understand well how the <STYLE ID="11">village's founder</STYLE> felt, putting down roots in this land long ago."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, so what slammed into me really was a boar.<PG>
Makes sense. It's enough to make you sorry to leave this land.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a land swarming with things like this, you could surely live healthy days and a long life, too.<PG>
But this isn't what I'm after.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure, it's tasty and it'd build up your stamina, but I'm not looking for health food.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I need a strength-giving food that can beat <STYLE ID="19" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> for certain.<PG>
But if boars that huge live here, maybe there's some secret I've never heard of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If what I'm looking for is in this land...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ginosuke-dono, why are there such big beasts in these mountains? Is there some secret after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, who can say... 
{PAUSE ""}
I thought it was simply that this land is fertile... 
{PAUSE ""}
but lately I have begun to think that may not be all there is to it. 
{PAUSE ""}
Ah, I am a doctor. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I study the ecology of the animals and plants around here as well."<PG>
Ginosuke-dono scratched his head, laughing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ginosuke-dono, a doctor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A man with the West's culture of the mind and a learning in biology wasn't someone you came across very often.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This man, maybe he could...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ginosuke-dono, there's something important I need to ask you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knelt, put both hands on the floor and faced Ginosuke-dono.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Wh-what is the matter, <STYLE ID="2">Fuji-dono</STYLE>... Please, sit at ease."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The truth is, I'm the kitchen steward of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="おうだ">Ouda</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> house. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Please... please, I want you to help the Ouda house!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\雪山.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―I told Ginosuke-dono how I'd come to be here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why I served my lord.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="19" RUBY="まがわ">Magawa</STYLE> was up to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I'd been feeling all the way here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd also wondered whether telling Ginosuke-dono all this might be dangerous.<PG>
After all, the people here lived cut off from the world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And whatever daimyo or landholder attacked them, they drove him off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It had to be a settlement full of real <STYLE ID="21" RUBY="てだ">veterans</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If things went wrong, I might be taken for an invader from outside too, and...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
