"<STYLE ID="2">Fuji-dono</STYLE>, please, sit at ease. 
{PAUSE ""}
I understand well what you were feeling when you came here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ginosuke-dono's calm <STYLE ID="22" RUBY="こわいろ">tone of voice</STYLE> hadn't changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I had said what I thought honestly, without any maneuvering.<PG>
Now we're facing each other, heart to heart, head-on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will Ginosuke-dono answer what I feel?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
