{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He sent her out of the room. Does that mean he's about to talk about something important?<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Fuji-dono</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
I regard your coming here―
{PAUSE ""}
with great wariness."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
