{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From those blue eyes comes a gaze so keen it sees right through to my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I'm not hiding anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it's precisely because I'm not hiding anything that he's wary of me.<PG>
