{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, that's right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If I refused that request, what would you do?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Would <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE> just go home?"<PG>
