{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if I report that to my lord... 
{PAUSE ""}
this is my lord we're talking about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A settlement with a Western doctor, giant beasts, and a record of holding off every invasion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way my lord wouldn't be interested.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
