{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Killing me right here...!<PG>
―For a while, only silence rings "<STYLE ID="24" RUBY="しん">forest</STYLE>"-quiet through this room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ginosuke-dono stares at me, without shifting his posture or his gaze.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A cold sweat runs down my forehead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now... what do I do?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What should I...!?<PG>
"Excuse me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
